WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.295 --> 00:00:05.457
Tap a tile in the palette to put it on the board.

2
00:00:05.457 --> 00:00:11.048
Drag a tile to move it. Hold it for its actions.

3
00:00:11.048 --> 00:00:16.175
Fill turns a tile into an outline, and back.

4
00:00:16.175 --> 00:00:19.138
Today’s task: show that 1/2 is the same as 2/4.

5
00:00:19.138 --> 00:00:21.611
Drag a 1/4 tile under the 1/2. It snaps into place.

6
00:00:21.611 --> 00:00:24.894
Two fourths fill the same length as one half.

7
00:00:24.894 --> 00:00:28.212
Drag across empty board to select many pieces at once.

8
00:00:28.212 --> 00:00:30.785
Drag one of them and they all move together.

9
00:00:30.785 --> 00:00:38.830
Labels can show fractions, percents or decimals.

10
00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:46.645
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
